name:
Determines which plane axis or axes to search the closest orientation to

0 = {xyz}
1 = {xy}
2 = {xz}
3 = {yz}
4 = {x}
5 = {y}
6 = {z}

Division parameter along pipe-like surface {v} domain that the second and sixth corners of the twisted boxes are on
(0.0 = {v}start, 1.0 = {v}end)

For best results parameter should be between 0 and 1 and be a larger number than parameter {v1} but a lower number than parameter {v3}

Division parameter along pipe-like surface {v} domain that the third and seventh corners of the twisted boxes are on
(0.0 = {v}start, 1.0 = {v}end)

For best results parameter should be between 0 and 1 and be a larger number than parameter {v2} but a lower number than parameter {v4}
